From: N0zoM1z0 <161784452+N0zoM1z0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:48:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [th02/main] Stones: decompile the main update, init and end
 functions

TLINK only shortens a far call into NOP/PUSH CS/CALL near when the target
segment starts at its group's frame. DIALOG_TEXT does not, so the call to
sub_129FC() in the same segment still needs the inline-asm stand-in.
---
